  "rule_statement": "A USER-SHOW PAIR is LIVE if, on the pair's own account, the gap between the last record-insertion instant at or before tau1 and the first record-insertion instant after tau1 is STRICTLY LESS THAN 632 days, where tau1 = [T0] + 108 x 24h and [T0] is the UTC midnight of T0 = max(S2 finale air date, S1 completion date). Insertion instants come from the stored Step 5 isotonic play-id calibration, are account-wide (every record in the sweep, other shows and movies included), are deduplicated on EXACT equality only, and are never claimed watched_at. If there is no insertion instant after tau1, or none at or before tau1, the pair is NOT LIVE. Liveness is a PAIR-LEVEL filter: one account can be live for one show and not for another, and no user is ever dropped wholesale.",
