    "what_survives": "decisions/0036 \u00a71's CONSERVATIVE-DIRECTION argument survives: a false-dead removes a pair and the liveness exclusion already biases the never-started share down (Step 14, bias 2), so higher is safer. It gives a direction. It does not identify a level."
